; RIFT BOSS POOL (sl-0180 wave 1A; REBUILT sl-0187+0188): Decel Wall
; — grade 3, comet pool + THE DUNGEON'S END ROOM. PLACEHOLDER id.
; ROOM-PATTERN family (sl-0188): ANCHOR — the boss holds its ground
; and the hanging walls travel the room regardless of the player
; (the choreography IS the fight). The anchor ALSO fixes the sl-0186
; walk finding structurally: the old keep-range chased the walker out
; of the dungeon boss room to its tether edge — an anchored holder
; can never leave its room. hp 380 = 35s at the g3 spine (sl-0187:
; 20-60s INTENSE; cooldowns compressed ~x0.7). One lead per pattern;
; elite amber; every number [T]; GATE 7 owns the length.

